{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟即將正式發售全新Xbox Nano迷你手柄，而在產品上市前夕，這款小巧設備的一項隱藏功能被曝光。最新消息顯示，Xbox Nano不僅是一款便攜式遊戲手柄，還能夠通過Wi-Fi直接連接Xbox Cloud Gaming雲遊戲平台，從而降低遊戲延遲並提升雲遊戲體驗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584906.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:00:42.588664+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T17:45:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:58:22.546798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T17:58:22.546798+00:00","content_hash":"0825538aaf011bea294a48f96c0362a6b7cb66641887d45edac758bef6f1aba9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}